ERC6909Premium_settle
├── when msg.sender is not authorized by debitFrom
│   └── it should revert with UnauthorizedSettler
├── when premiumFiller is not authorized by debitFrom
│   └── it should revert with UnauthorizedPremiumFiller
├── when balanceOf(debitFrom, tokenId) is less than amount
│   └── it should revert with InsufficientBalance
├── when amount is zero
│   └── it should no-op successfully
├── when all checks pass
│   ├── it should decrement debitFrom's balance by amount
│   ├── it should IERC20.safeTransfer amount to recipient
│   ├── it should emit Settled
│   └── it should complete atomically
├── when the token reverts in transfer
│   └── it should revert with the bubbled token error and leave balance unchanged (no partial debit)
├── when the token returns false on transfer
│   └── it should revert with SafeERC20FailedOperation
├── when FoT token transfer delivers less than amount
│   └── it should revert with SettleBalanceMismatch and leave balance unchanged
└── when a reentrant settle is attempted
    └── it should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
